│ prospect doing without pitching in your first turn.' vs '1: Introduction...  │
│ Always clarify in your greeting the reason why you are calling.'             │
│   Impact   : The LLM's behavior is unpredictable under contradictory         │
│ instructions; it may choose any one of them, resulting in inconsistent       │
│ output                                                                       │
│   Fix      : Remove one of the conflicting rules, or add a priority          │
│ declaration specifying which rule takes precedence                           │
